SUPERSEDED — split into two increments after manager/user review.

The original CD-03 was ~3x the size of anything verified in this pipeline so far,
and both CD-01 and CD-02 needed rework cycles at roughly a third of that size.
Split so each half gets its own plan, its own verification and a diff small
enough to review honestly:

  work/CD-03a-dashboard-list-edit/task.md   list + edit existing clients,
                                            feature toggles + guards,
                                            the revalidation tag,
                                            two standing findings
  work/CD-03b-create-wizard/task.md         the create wizard, transaction,
                                            generated admin password,
                                            sitemap filter for half-configured
                                            clients

CD-03a delivers value on its own: every client visible and editable from one
gated screen. CD-03b is what makes onboarding possible without a developer.
